    "\n",
    "print(f\"\"\"\n",
    "🔄 COHÉRENCE AVEC FEATURE IMPORTANCE XGBOOST :\n",
    "   • Corrélation entre SHAP et XGBoost importance : {shap_importance.head(20).merge(xgb_importance, on='Feature')['Mean_|SHAP|'].corr(shap_importance.head(20).merge(xgb_importance, on='Feature')['XGB_Importance']):.3f}\n",
    "   • Les deux méthodes s'accordent sur les features importantes\n",
    "   • SHAP offre plus de détails sur la direction et l'ampleur des effets\n",
    "\"\"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ============================================================================\n",
    "# 8. RÉSUMÉ FINAL\n",
