    "      \"\\n\",\n",
    "      \"🏆 MEILLEUR MODÈLE : XGBoost\\n\",\n",
    "      \"   • R² = 0.7349 (explique 73.49% de la variance)\\n\",\n",
    "      \"   • RMSE = 1844.76 €/m² (erreur moyenne)\\n\",\n",
    "      \"\\n\",\n",
    "      \"📈 AMÉLIORATIONS vs MCO :\\n\",\n",
    "      \"   • R² : +14.84%\\n\",\n",
